        },
        {
          "text": "Mbona abapfuye, abahambaye n’aboroshe, bahagaze imbere y’iyo ntebe; ibitabo birazingururwa. Kand’ ikindi gitabo kirazingururwa, ni co gitabo c’ubugingo. Abapfuye bacirwa imanza z’ivyanditswe mur’ ivyo bitabo, zikwiranye n’ivyo bakoze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
